		<item>
		<title>
		By: okot brian		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/nephrotic-and-nephritic-syndromes/#comment-801</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[okot brian]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 21 Nov 2023 08:08:59 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=3840#comment-801</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[I would like to extend my sincere appreciation to this brilliant idea that has helped so many people in the medical institutions. However, I have a compliment, it would also be good if you updated the notes since there are some conditions that we cannot find in this revision guide, and they are mostly for us the comprehensive nurses of diploma.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I would like to extend my sincere appreciation to this brilliant idea that has helped so many people in the medical institutions. However, I have a compliment, it would also be good if you updated the notes since there are some conditions that we cannot find in this revision guide, and they are mostly for us the comprehensive nurses of diploma.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
